:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Li'l Flying Cat (Enemy)]].''
'''Li'l Bird Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.5 Update|Version 4.5]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Lucky Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]] increases health, attack power and range and gains the Strong Against [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]] and [[Zombie Killer]] abilities. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 11.5 Update|Version 11.5]].

